                "description": {
                    "value": "<p>30 feet. Those who meet the gaze of a wild hunt horse are overwhelmed by the pressure of the hunt's legacy. A creature that ends its turn in the emanation must succeed at a @Check[will|dc:33] save or be @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.Slowed]{Slowed 1} (@UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.Slowed]{Slowed 2} on a critical failure) until it leaves. The wild hunt hound can deactivate or activate this aura with a single action, which has the concentrate trait.</p>"
